Subject: [PATCH] game/fft: register 1.5.1 (v524288) and its job-pool wake cut

A profile derived from a 1.5.1 dump lost the wake-up cut (upstream
seedds/nxnative issue #3046): blank window on Mac and iPad, audio runs,
never draws. 1.5.1's main (ace351a1...) keeps the same code and site as
1.4.0, so the profile now registers the build row and the cut for both
builds; the patch index follows.

The game note also records the widescreen bring-up plan for a 19.5:9
phone panel: the forced render pair is a dead end (h_nvnMemoryPoolMap
null Map, DM_ALIAS_SIZE no help), the route is the render-pair load
redirect (1.5.1 has 1920x1080 literals at 0x38E38 / 0x3181F8), then the
projection stubs, HUD anchors and touch scale.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: upstream seedds/nxnative issue #3046 asks for it: a profile derived from a 1.5.1 dump loses the wake-up cut (blank window, audio runs, never draws)
Issue: fork-wide-aspect bring-up (see patches/README.md)

